          "id": "krea2mood397-9a893d7666b947",
          "alias": "Cinematic Final Fantasy 3D Render",
          "prompt": "Style: A richly cinematic 3D-illustration style built on meticulously detailed volumetric modeling rendered with near-photographic dimensional conviction, dramatic film-grade lighting establishing epic, emotionally charged mood within every frame, soft subsurface-scattered rendering giving skin a convincing, luminous depth, confident ambient occlusion and reflective response settling naturally into every contour, and a polished, blockbuster-grade rendering intensity built for sweeping, story-driven visual spectacle. Influenced by: Square Enix cinematic-rendering direction, real-time 3D-animation technique, subsurface-scattering character-design practice, cinematic three-point lighting method.. Subject:{prompt}",
