          "alias": "Lowbrow Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A darkly whimsical illustration style built on cartoonish exaggeration mixed with unsettling, surreal juxtaposition, confident smooth rendering that gives every form a glossy, pop-adjacent polish, bold caricatured proportion pushed toward grotesque or absurd extremes, a rebellious, subversive humor woven through otherwise technically polished composition, and a bold, countercultural intensity that feels irreverent, playful, and quietly unsettling. Influenced by: Robert Williams, Mark Ryden, lowbrow-art movement tradition, pop-surrealist illustration practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
