          "id": "krea2mood397-ab216be2ea1248",
          "alias": "Coraline Stop-Motion Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A meticulously crafted stop-motion illustration style built on precise, doll-like proportion carrying an uncanny, porcelain-smooth finish, subtle handcrafted imperfection visible in gentle asymmetry rather than digital uniformity, moody, controlled lighting establishing a quietly unsettling, dreamlike atmosphere, meticulous attention to fine detail rendered with obsessive miniature-scale patience, and a whimsical yet faintly eerie handcrafted intensity that feels intimate, meticulous, and gently uncanny. Influenced by: Henry Selick, LAIKA Studios stop-motion tradition, meticulous puppet-fabrication technique, gothic-whimsical animation practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
