          "id": "krea2mood397-86698953ef6342",
          "alias": "Kurzgesagt Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A clean, flat vector-illustration style built on confident geometric simplification of every form into smooth, rounded shapes, minimal shading limited to subtle gradient or soft contact shadow, a friendly, approachable clarity that favors instant conceptual readability over naturalistic rendering, meticulous compositional organization guiding the eye through dense informational content with playful ease, and a bright, whimsical educational charm that feels scientific, cheerful, and effortlessly digestible. Influenced by: Kurzgesagt studio house style, flat-vector explainer-illustration tradition, minimalist infographic-design technique, contemporary educational-animation practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
