          "alias": "Star Wars: The Clone Wars Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, angular animation-illustration style built on stylized, geometric character proportion with sharply defined, faceted silhouette construction, confident cel-shaded rendering with graphic, high-contrast shadow blocking rather than smooth gradation, dramatic cinematic lighting establishing epic, sweeping mood within stylized composition, meticulous attention to dynamic, action-driven posing balanced against clean graphic clarity, and a bold, blockbuster-grade stylized-animation intensity that feels both angular and cinematically grand. Influenced by: Dave Filoni, stylized 3D-animation technique, geometric character-design practice, cinematic sci-fi animation method.. Subject:{prompt}",
