        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-aedb8dac245e44",
          "alias": "Vignette-Framed Central Composition",
          "prompt": "Style: A tightly unified illustration style built on a distinct central cluster containing figure and surrounding elements together as one cohesive silhouette, generous negative space extending outward on every side rather than a continuous filled composition, the enclosing elements arranged deliberately to form an implied frame-like boundary rather than a naturalistic full scene, meticulous compositional discipline keeping every detail confined within that central shape while the periphery stays quiet and empty, and a poised, deliberate graphic clarity that treats negative space itself as an essential compositional partner. Influenced by: contemporary editorial-illustration composition technique, vignette-portrait framing practice, negative-space compositional design, decorative-border illustration tradition.. Subject:{prompt}",
