          "alias": "Frutiger Aero",
          "prompt": "Style: A glossy, optimistic digital-aesthetic style built on smooth, dewy translucence layered over every surface like a soft protective sheen, bright, evenly diffused lighting that keeps the whole composition feeling clean and airy, gentle lens-flare bloom radiating with cheerful, tech-utopian positivity, crisp, rounded rendering logic that softens every edge into approachable, friendly polish, and a buoyant, forward-looking digital sincerity rooted in mid-2000s techno-optimism. Influenced by: mid-2000s tech-interface design tradition, Frutiger Aero aesthetic movement, glossy UI-rendering practice, early Web 2.0 digital-design technique.. Subject:{prompt}",
