          "alias": "Alex Grey Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A visionary, anatomically luminous illustration style built on translucent layered rendering that reveals internal structure and energetic form simultaneously within a single figure, meticulous symmetrical composition radiating outward with mandala-like precision, an intense, glowing internal luminosity that seems to emanate from beneath the outermost extent, dense, interwoven detail merging scientific anatomical accuracy with spiritual, mystical iconography, and a mesmerizing, transcendent intensity that treats the body as both physical structure and radiant energy field. Influenced by: Alex Grey, visionary-art movement tradition, anatomical illustration technique, sacred-geometry digital-painting practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
