          "alias": "Vignette Sticker",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, self-contained graphic illustration style built on a crisp, clean bold white outline that isolates the subject from a plain white background, as a single cohesive shape contained within a distinct central cluster, generous white negative space surrounding that cluster with a thick, uniform contour holding the entire boundary, confidently simplified color fields with minimal internal shading, a slightly raised, glossy die-cut quality suggested through a subtle contour highlight tracing the outer extent, and a cheerful, punchy graphic charm built for immediate, repeatable visual impact. Influenced by: vinyl sticker/decal design tradition, detailed vector illustration technique, die-cut print production method, negative-space compositional design.. Subject:{prompt}",
