        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-80e7f134d0df47",
          "alias": "Icon/Emoticon Vignette",
          "prompt": "Style: A compact, simplified illustration style built on a distinct central cluster containing the subject reduced to its most essential recognizable shapes, generous negative space surrounding that cluster rather than a full-frame scene, bold, confidently bounded flat color fields separated by clean, uniform outline, minimal internal detail favoring instant small-scale readability over rendering complexity, and a cheerful, graphic economy that treats the whole composition as a single, immediately legible symbol. Influenced by: emoji/icon-design tradition, flat-vector illustration technique, minimalist symbol-design practice, negative-space compositional design.. Subject:{prompt}",
