        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-9babc8d46a054e",
          "alias": "Blueprint",
          "prompt": "Style: A precise, technical illustration style built on crisp white linework laid over a deep, uniform blue field, exacting mechanical accuracy in every construction line and dimensional marker, minimal to no shading beyond the line itself carrying all structural information, a rigorous, drafting-level clarity that favors exact proportion over expressive interpretation, and a clean, methodical exactness rooted in centuries of engineering and architectural drafting discipline. Influenced by: technical/engineering-drawing tradition, architectural-blueprint drafting technique, cyanotype printing process, orthographic-projection drawing method.. Subject:{prompt}",
