        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-1bcc6a636c9149",
          "alias": "The Mitchells vs. The Machines animation Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A vibrant, hybrid animation-illustration style built on smooth 3D-rendered character forms overlaid with wet fluid brushstrokes and painterly-like accents layered as texture directly into the frame, exaggerated, elastic proportion balancing 3D dimensionality with 2D cartoon energy, bold, expressive shading that mixes painterly gradient with graphic flat-color punch, meticulous attention to chaotic, personality-driven posing charged with comedic warmth, and a distinctive, boundary-breaking animation intensity that feels handmade, playful, and unmistakably contemporary. Influenced by: Sony Pictures Animation, mixed 2D/3D hybrid-animation technique, paint-overlay practice, contemporary indie-animation character-design method.. Subject:{prompt}",
