          "id": "krea2mood397-79d23f6c70694a",
          "alias": "Steampunk",
          "prompt": "Style: A richly ornamental Victorian-industrial illustration style built on intricate mechanical detail rendered with meticulous, gear-and-cog precision, dramatic directional lighting catching every riveted contour and polished brass-adjacent gleam, confident linework blending vintage engraving discipline with fantastical technical invention, a hushed, adventurous grandeur carried through richly layered ornamental complexity, and a nostalgic, retro-futurist intensity that feels handcrafted, inventive, and unmistakably era-blending. Influenced by: Jules Verne illustration tradition, Victorian engraving technique, retro-futurist mechanical-design practice, steampunk concept-art method.,. Subject:{prompt}",
