        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-27a255e2d7f740",
          "alias": "Jean-Gabriel Domergue Style",
          "prompt": "Style: An elegant Art Deco portrait-illustration style built on smooth, confident linework tracing idealized, statuesque proportion with graceful economy, refined tonal shading applied with restrained, sophisticated subtlety rather than dramatic contrast, a poised, glamorous stillness carried through deliberate, composed posing, meticulous attention to graceful line quality over exhaustive detail, and a chic, timeless sophistication that feels effortlessly elegant and quietly luxurious. Influenced by: Jean-Gabriel Domergue, Art Deco portraiture but modern, French illustration contemporary technique , glamour-digital illustration,. Subject:{prompt}",
