          "id": "krea2mood397-fe7dfed84e304b",
          "alias": "Modern Lithography",
          "prompt": "Style: A refined printmaking-inspired contemporary  illustration style built on flat, confidently limited color layers reminiscent of hand-pulled stone-plate printing, subtle grain and texture mimicking the imperfect registration of lithographic process, clean bold linework holding each color plane with graphic precision, restrained tonal shading achieved through crosshatched or stippled print texture rather than smooth gradients, and a contemporary print-craft polish that feels tactile, considered, and editorial. Influenced by: modern lithographic printmaking, poster art, screenprint illustration technique, editorial print design.. Subject:{prompt}",
