        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-de26b3845f1e42",
          "alias": "Op-Art Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A minimalist line-based hypnotic optical-abstract-illustration style built on precise repeating geometric stylized and angular patterning that tricks the eye into perceived movement and depth, rhythmic curvy and angular bold linework or shape progressions that pulse and vibrate, a rigorous mathematical geometry replacing any painterly looseness, figure and pattern merging so the body itself becomes part of the rhythm, and a crisp, disorienting, almost hypnotic graphic intensity that rewards sustained looking.subject abstracted into shapes within shapes, Influenced by: Bridget Riley, Victor Vasarely, minimalist bold-fixed-width-lines geometric abstraction, kinetic op-art technique.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-3d_render_3D渲染",
