        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-d134eadefb274e",
          "alias": "Overwatch Concept Art",
          "prompt": "Style: A polished, vibrant game-illustration style built on clean, confident linework blended with smooth painterly rendering, bright, saturated lighting logic establishing bold, heroic clarity within a single dynamic composition, clean, readable silhouette design, dynamic, energetic posing charged with confident personality and readable character archetype, and a polished, blockbuster-grade game-art vibrancy built for instant character appeal and franchise recognition. Influenced by: Overwatch video-game, Blizzard Entertainment concept-art direction, stylized hero-shooter character-design tradition, painterly game-illustration technique, vibrant franchise key-art practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
