        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-c6156187ceec4c",
          "alias": "Psychedelia Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A hallucinatory, maximalist illustration style built on swirling, undulating linework that warps form into rhythmic, organic distortion, dense repeating pattern-work that pulses and radiates outward from every surface, a deliberate flattening of depth that lets ornamental motif and figure merge into a single continuous visual field, hypnotic radial or wave-based compositional energy charged with sensory overload, and an ecstatic, mind-bending intensity that feels perpetually in motion even in stillness. Influenced by: Peter Max, concert-poster illustration tradition, psychedelic rock album-art technique,drug induced art, Art Nouveau ornamental linework reimagined.. Subject:{prompt}",
