        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-207de33ad8fc4e",
          "alias": "Playmobil",
          "prompt": "Style: A blocky, modular figure style built on simplified, cylindrical limbs and clip-jointed construction standing in for naturalistic anatomy, a glossy, uniformly smooth plastic-like finish applied consistently across every segment, a distinctive rounded head with minimal, painted-style facial simplification, confident, clean separation between individually distinguishable component pieces, and a cheerful, systematized toy-design precision rooted in decades of modular construction-set tradition. Influenced by: Playmobil product-design tradition, modular construction-toy aesthetic, plastic-injection product-visualization practice, procedural toy-figure rendering method.. Subject:{prompt}",
