        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-cdca708f64e844",
          "alias": "Camille Walala Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A vibrant, maximalist illustration style built on bold, confidently bounded geometric shapes arranged in dense, rhythmic repetition, thick, uniform outline holding every flat-color region with graphic precision, an energetic, kaleidoscopic pattern-work covering nearly every extent of the composition, a playful, optical-pop confidence replacing any naturalistic rendering entirely, and a joyful, high-energy graphic-design intensity that feels bold, celebratory, and unmistakably contemporary. Influenced by: Camille Walala,  geometric pattern-illustration technique, contemporary mural-art practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
