        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-a913a3a4c12a46",
          "alias": "Neon Halftone Retro-Thriller Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A striking screenprint-inspired illustration style built on bold, high-contrast graphic shapes rendered through dense horizontal line-scan patterning that mimics offset-print texture, dramatic dual-toned lighting where sharp electric accents cross the subject against deep, silhouetted shadow, confident vector-clean contour holding every form with poster-ready precision, atmospheric radiating arcs suggesting motion and depth behind the central figure, and a bold, cinematic screenprint intensity that feels stylish, tense, and unmistakably retro-thriller. Influenced by: Jonathan Burton, contemporary screenprint movie-poster tradition, halftone scan-line illustration technique, synthwave-adjacent poster-design practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
