        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-29d3586aa7284d",
          "alias": "Negative Space Focused Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A deliberately restrained illustration style built on a single confident focal cluster surrounded by vast, empty extent, minimal linework rendering only what's essential to read the subject clearly, a confident economy where the unmarked space carries as much compositional weight as the mark itself, silhouette and shape doing the primary storytelling work rather than internal detail, and a quiet, contemplative elegance that treats emptiness as an active, deliberate compositional partner. Influenced by: minimalist negative-space illustration tradition, Japanese ma compositional philosophy, contemporary editorial silhouette technique, reductive graphic-design practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
