          "alias": "Collectible Figure",
          "prompt": "Style: A meticulously sculpted 1:12 scale action subject cast in rigid injection-molded ABS plastic with a glossy top coat, photographed under diffused lighting with a deep focus shot capturing every sculpted detail. Influenced by: the classic action figure toy, Hasbro product, 1980s action-toy.. Subject:{prompt}",
