        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-787d850a7cad4c",
          "alias": "Low Relief Sculpture",
          "prompt": "Style: A dimensionally subtle sculptural style built on shallow, raised form projecting only slightly beyond its background rather than standing fully in the round, confident tonal modeling constructed entirely through carved depth and directional light rather than drawn line, dramatic raking illumination that reveals every subtle contour and recessed groove with graphic clarity, a restrained, disciplined economy of projection where even minimal relief conveys convincing volume, and a timeless, classical gravitas rooted in centuries of relief-carving tradition. Influenced by: classical bas-relief sculpture tradition, Lorenzo Ghiberti, architectural relief-carving technique, academic sculptural-modeling method.. Subject:{prompt}",
