        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-f5db38078be945",
          "alias": "Animal Crossing Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A soft, rounded 3D-simulation illustration style built on gentle, oversized proportion favoring charm, smooth subsurface-scattered shading giving forms a warm, inviting glow, bright, cheerful lighting logic that keeps every scene feeling wholesome and inviting, meticulous attention to whimsical, cozy detail rendered with cheerful simplicity rather than technical grit, and a wholesome, gentle life-simulation intensity that feels playful, comforting, and effortlessly charming. Influenced by: Animal Crossing Nintendo art, stylized 3D-simulation, cozy life-simulation game-art, whimsical cartoon-render,.. Subject:{prompt}",
