        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-0d68b4e4dc3b4c",
          "alias": "Partial Wireframe 3D",
          "prompt": "Style: A dimensionally precise digital-illustration style built on smooth, volumetric modeling that transitions abruptly into exposed geometric mesh across a portion of the extent, meticulously calculated illumination and specular response covering the fully rendered sections while the mesh-revealed areas stay flat and diagrammatic, confident sculptural construction contrasted against clean, technical grid-lines, a deliberate tension between finished dimensional realism and raw underlying structure, and a technically precise, computer-generated intensity that treats construction itself as part of the compositional subject. Influenced by: real-time 3D-rendering technique, wireframe-mesh visualization practice, physically based rendering (PBR) method, CGI production-pipeline aesthetic.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-3d_render_3D渲染",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0065.jpg",
