        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-2372c8aef4dd47",
          "alias": "Boichi Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A meticulously rendered manga-illustration style built on dense, hyper-precise linework that treats anatomy and mechanical detail with equal obsessive accuracy, dramatic high-contrast shading that carves powerful, sculptural form through confident cross-hatched shadow, a technically disciplined realism balancing muscular anatomical grounding with dynamic, kinetic posing, meticulous attention to material and structural logic rewarding close inspection, and a bold, technically virtuosic manga intensity that feels equal parts scientific precision and explosive physicality. Influenced by: Boichi, Dr. Stone manga art tradition, hyper-detailed manga illustration technique, technical-precision character-design practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
