          "alias": "Cinematic Anime",
          "prompt": "Style: premium animation aesthetics characterized by refined linework, sophisticated lighting design, cinematic composition, nuanced atmospheric depth, polished rendering, and emotionally driven visual storytelling, blending the clarity of high-end anime production with filmic realism through controlled detail, expressive staging, and exceptional artistic cohesion, reminiscent of Makoto Shinkai and Yoshiyuki Sadamoto, inspired by Your Name and Evangelion: 3.0+1.0 Thrice Upon a Time.. Subject:{prompt}",
