          "alias": "Granblue Fantasy Pin-Up Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A richly detailed JRPG character-illustration style built on crisp painterly linework blended seamlessly into soft airbrushed shading, glossy semi-realistic rendering that gives skin and hair a polished, luminous finish without tipping into full photorealism, confident glamorous pin-up posing framed with clean graphic composition, delicately layered ornamental costume detail rendered with meticulous craftsmanship, and a vibrant, high-production mobile-gacha polish that feels equally at home as key art and collectible card illustration. Influenced by: Minaba Hideo, Cygames character-art direction, JRPG gacha illustration technique, semi-realistic anime rendering.. Subject:{prompt}",
