        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-eed2b68152bd49",
          "alias": "JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A flamboyant, hyper-stylized manga-illustration style built on exaggerated, statuesque anatomy carrying dramatic fashion-forward posing, bold, high-contrast linework rendering musculature with sculptural, almost architectural precision, saturated graphic patterning integrated directly into confident silhouette design, dynamic, theatrical composition charged with operatic intensity and flair, and a bold, unapologetically stylish shōnen extravagance that feels equal parts high fashion and larger-than-life spectacle. Influenced by: Hirohiko Araki, flamboyant shōnen-manga tradition, sculptural anatomical-illustration technique, theatrical fashion-forward character-design practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
