        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-d3565e0229e54f",
          "alias": "Sailor Moon Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A luminous, romantic shōjo-anime illustration style built on delicate, sparkling linework paired with soft cel shading punctuated by dreamy glow and starburst highlight accents, large, deeply detailed eyes carrying the emotional core of every expression, flowing, elongated proportions with a graceful, idealized elegance, decorative sparkle and floral motif woven lightly through hair and costume rendering, and a nostalgic, magical-girl radiance that feels tender, whimsical, and unmistakably 90s-shōjo. Influenced by: Naoko Takeuchi, 90s shōjo-anime tradition, magical-girl cel-animation technique, Toei Animation production practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
