          "id": "krea2mood397-de4bf71c4e9e40",
          "alias": "Gravity Falls Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, flat cartoon illustration style built on confident, evenly weighted outline holding simplified, slightly angular proportions, bright, evenly applied flat color with minimal shading beyond basic form-defining contact shadow, a quirky, endearing character-design language balancing comedic exaggeration with grounded charm, cheerful yet mysterious compositional tone favoring instant readability, and a nostalgic, small-town animated warmth that feels playful, whimsical, and quietly adventurous. Influenced by: Alex Hirsch, Disney Television Animation tradition, flat-color cartoon technique, contemporary mystery-adventure cartoon practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
