          "alias": "Futurama Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, flat cartoon illustration style built on confident, evenly weighted outline holding rounded, slightly angular proportions, bright, evenly applied flat color with minimal shading beyond basic form-defining contact shadow, a retro-futurist visual sensibility balancing comedic exaggeration with sleek design confidence, cheerful, uncomplicated composition prioritizing instant readability, and a witty, satirical animated energy that feels playful, imaginative, and unmistakably adult-oriented. Influenced by: Matt Groening, David X. Cohen, flat-color adult-animation tradition, retro-futurist cartoon-design practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
