          "alias": "Peanuts Cartoon Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A charming, simplified illustration style built on confident, minimal outline holding rounded, flat, evenly applied color fill, an endearing, understated character-design language favoring gentle simplicity, expressive dot-eyes and economical facial gesture carrying quiet emotional depth, and a timeless, wholesome sincerity that feels tender, nostalgic, and effortlessly comforting. Influenced by: Charles Schulz, Peanuts cartoon, mid-century newspaper-comic-strip tradition, flat-color minimalist design technique, gentle everyday-life illustration practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
