        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-0102a4299b1441",
          "alias": "Frank Miller Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A stark, high-contrast graphic-novel illustration style built on bold, confident inking with dramatic, oversized spotted blacks that carve the composition into aggressive light-and-dark extremes, minimal internal detail replaced by sheer graphic silhouette, sharp angular linework rendering violent, kinetic composition with brutal economy, a hardboiled, noir-driven starkness charged with pulp menace, and a bold, unflinching graphic-novel intensity that feels stripped-down, aggressive, and unmistakably iconic. Influenced by: Frank Miller, Sin City graphic-novel tradition, high-contrast noir-comic technique, minimalist spotted-black inking practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
