        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-cb45cca2912542",
          "alias": "Archie Comics Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A clean, wholesome cartoon illustration style built on confident, evenly weighted outline defining simplified, appealing proportions, flat, bright color fill with minimal shading beyond basic form-defining shadow, an approachable, mid-century newspaper-strip charm carried through rounded, friendly facial design, cheerful, uncomplicated composition prioritizing instant readability over rendering complexity, and a nostalgic, all-American wholesome energy that feels timeless and effortlessly friendly. Influenced by: Dan DeCarlo, mid-century American comic-strip tradition, flat-color comic-inking technique, newspaper-syndicate cartoon practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
