          "id": "krea2mood397-6e405801dd1941",
          "alias": "Mark Brooks / Manapul Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A refined modern comic illustration style merging crisp, glossy semi-realistic linework with loose, atmospheric painterly washes, confident anatomical precision balanced against fluid, watercolor-like softness bleeding through backgrounds and costume, delicate cross-hatched shading giving skin and fabric a tactile, hand-finished quality, dynamic yet quietly cinematic posing that favors mood over bombast, and a polished, contemporary mainstream-comic sensibility that bridges tight illustrative control with expressive brushwork. Influenced by: Mark Brooks, Francis Manapul, modern mainstream comic illustration, watercolor comic-art technique.. Subject:{prompt}",
