          "id": "krea2mood397-f023c74bac7444",
          "alias": "Psychological Thriller Pulp Digital Painting",
          "prompt": "Style: A moody, high-contrast digital painting style built on pulp-novel cover sensibilities, with dramatic chiaroscuro lighting slicing across the face and figure, saturated noir color grading in deep colors, painterly brushwork that keeps edges slightly loose and expressive rather than photoreal, unsettling tilted or claustrophobic composition hinting at hidden threat or obsession, and a tense, voyeuristic atmosphere charged with paranoia and simmering danger. Influenced by: vintage pulp paperback cover art, Drew Struzan, film-noir movie posters, Gregory Manchess-style narrative illustration.. Subject:{prompt}",
