        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-c6e5994cacbe4a",
          "alias": "Clean Line Art",
          "prompt": "Style: refined line-focused aesthetics characterized by crisp contours, exceptional visual clarity, disciplined draftsmanship, controlled line weight, and highly readable form construction, emphasizing precision, elegance, and structural coherence through polished execution, simplified visual noise, and a timeless graphic sensibility that balances sophistication with effortless readability, reminiscent of Hergé and Yves Chaland, inspired by Tintin and Blake et Mortimer.. Subject:{prompt}",
