        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-7ae29dbf451849",
          "alias": "Jim Lee Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A dynamic, high-detail mainstream comic-illustration style built on confident, powerful anatomy rendered with meticulous cross-hatched inking, dramatic musculature and dense linework carrying real sculptural weight, sharp, dynamic foreshortening charged with kinetic action-movie energy, richly detailed costume and texture rewarding close inspection, and a bold, blockbuster comic-cover intensity that feels polished, powerful, and instantly iconic. Influenced by: Jim Lee, WildStorm/DC/Marvel mainstream comic-illustration tradition, dynamic cross-hatched inking technique, action-driven cover-illustration practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
