        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-bd38c694350e4e",
          "alias": "Joe Quesada Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A sleek, hyper-glossy painted comic-illustration style built on immaculately smooth gradient rendering that trades traditional inking for glassy, airbrushed precision, dramatic directional lighting carving sharp, confident highlight across muscular, dynamic anatomy, meticulously controlled reflective sheen giving every form a polished, high-production finish, a stylized, exaggerated silhouette balancing painterly depth with graphic mainstream-comic clarity, and a sleek, cinematic comic-cover intensity built for instantly striking newsstand impact. Influenced by: Joe Quesada, painted comic-cover illustration tradition, hyper-glossy digital-rendering technique, mainstream superhero-illustration practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
