        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-78707bbd544c4a",
          "alias": "glossy Comic-digital art",
          "prompt": "Style: A vibrant, glossy comic-digital art style built on confident, clean design merged with extremely smooth airbrushed shading, luminous semi-realistic skin rendering with sharp specular highlights , a playful, curve-forward sensibility charged with confident vibes, a backdrop providing energetic contrast to the crisp central figure, and a polished, vibrant character-illustration intensity that feels contemporary, glossy, and effortlessly eye-catching. outlines are smoothed into invisibility,  Influenced by: contemporary digital illustration tradition, semi-realistic airbrush-rendering technique, centric compositional practice, glossy character-illustration method.. Subject:{prompt}",
