        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-b61aea5c22c449",
          "alias": "Robin Eley Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A photorealistic figurative painting style defined by translucent elments, rendered with uncanny material precision, cool, clinical studio lighting that reveals every fold, wrinkle, and light-refraction in the material textures, skin rendered with hyperreal softness, neutral backgrounds that keep full focus on the interplay between body and translucency, and a quiet, conceptual tension between concealment and exposure rendered with immaculate painterly control. Influenced by: Robin Eley, hyperrealist oil painting, contemporary figurative fine art, photorealism technique.,. Subject:{prompt}",
