        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-ab235f82a49a4a",
          "alias": "Dark Fantasy Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A brooding, atmospheric fantasy painting style built on deep tenebrist shadow that swallows the edges of every composition, a single dramatic source of light carving form out of near-total darkness, richly textured painterly surfaces giving textures a weathered, visceral weight, an oppressive, foreboding stillness charged with looming threat, and a heavy, mythic gravitas that feels both epic and quietly menacing. Influenced by: dark fantasy concept-art tradition, Zdzisław Beksiński, tenebrist oil painting technique, gothic fantasy illustration.,. Subject:{prompt}",
