          "id": "krea2mood397-016da179767944",
          "alias": "Kay Nielsen Style",
          "prompt": "Style: An elegant, ornamental fairy-tale illustration style built on sinuous, decorative linework that flows with calligraphic grace, flat decorative patterning applied with meticulous restraint rather than painterly shading, elongated, stylized delicacy, a hushed, dreamlike stillness pervading every composition, and a refined, storybook elegance that feels simultaneously ancient and timeless in its decorative precision. Influenced by: Kay Nielsen, Golden Age children's book illustration, Art Nouveau decorative technique, Scandinavian fairy-tale illustration.. Subject:{prompt}",
