          "prompt": "Style: A moody, luminous digital-painting style built on soft glowing directional light that carves powerful, sculptural dimensionality against enveloping darkness, richly layered painterly brushwork blending into smooth atmospheric transition, dramatic anatomical grounding rendered with confident, almost hyperreal muscular tension, a hushed, cinematic intensity carried through restrained, dramatic contrast, and a technically masterful, contemporary painterly gravitas that feels both epic and intimately grounded. Influenced by: Ismail Inceoglu, contemporary digital-painting technique, cinematic figurative-illustration practice, dramatic chiaroscuro rendering method.. Subject:{prompt}",
