          "alias": "Faceted Painterly Digital painting",
          "prompt": "Style: A confidently stylized digital-painting style built on sharp, angular brushwork that constructs form through faceted, geometric planes of light and shadow rather than smooth blending, crisp specular highlight catching every sharp transitional edge with glossy precision, a soft-to-graphic tension between rendered texture and boldly simplified surrounding shape, meticulous attention to expressive, softly rendered detail set against otherwise confident graphic construction, and a polished, editorial-illustration finish that feels contemporary, stylish, and effortlessly striking. Influenced by: contemporary faceted digital-painting technique, semi-realistic editorial-illustration practice, stylized rendering method, painterly geometric-shading tradition.. Subject:{prompt}",
