          "id": "krea2mood397-5cafc88afdc346",
          "alias": "Glossy Semi-Realistic",
          "prompt": "Style: A striking digital-illustration style built on confident, clean digital-gradient-linework combined with extremely smooth airbrushed shading, very glassy specular highlights for immediate emotional focus, meticulous attention to soft luminous rendering contrasted against crisp, decisive contour, a hushed, moody intimacy carried through close, direct framing, and a polished, contemporary illustration intensity that feels both delicate and graphically sharp. Influenced by: Sakimichan,  Ilya Kuvshinov, WLOP, semi-realistic anime rendering technique, contemporary gacha-adjacent illustration practice.  ray-tracing-adjacent aesthetics,. Subject:{prompt}",
