        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-2002ffe8ef884a",
          "alias": "Ilya Kuvshinov Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A soft, luminous anime-realism illustration style built on delicately blended airbrushed shading that gives skin a gentle glowing translucency, fine detailed linework reserved for hair and eyes while broader forms stay softly rendered, a hushed, contemplative stillness carried through gentle ambient lighting, subtle painterly texture in hair strands contrasted against smooth porcelain-like skin, and a quietly elegant, understated polish that feels intimate, modern, and effortlessly refined. Influenced by: Ilya Kuvshinov, modern anime-realism illustration, digital airbrush technique, semi-realistic character art.. Subject:{prompt}",
