        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-d44bf801e6ae47",
          "alias": "Luminous Pastel",
          "prompt": "Style: A softly radiant illustration style built on gentle, powdery tonal layering that blends effortlessly at every transition, a diffused, glowing luminosity emerging from within rather than reflecting off the exterior, delicate, unhurried blending replacing any sharp contrast or hard edge, a hushed, tender softness carried through subtle textural graininess reminiscent of layered chalk, and a quietly graceful, dreamlike gentleness that feels intimate, delicate, and effortlessly warm. Influenced by: pastel painting tradition, soft-chalk blending technique, classical photographic drawing practice, contemporary digital pastel-rendering method.. Subject:{prompt}",
