        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-f7d9dc27e45644",
          "alias": "MTG (Magic: The Gathering) Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A richly painterly fantasy card-illustration style built on confident traditional-media brushwork rendered with meticulous narrative clarity, dramatic atmospheric lighting that establishes mood and magical energy within a single evocative frame, richly textured surface detail across textures, and environment rendered with tactile painterly weight, a wide range of stylistic voices unified by strong storytelling composition and evocative world-building intensity, and a polished, collectible-card-art gravitas built to spark imagination within a small frame. Influenced by: Rebecca Guay, Wizards of the Coast card-art tradition, painterly fantasy illustration technique, narrative concept-art composition.. Subject:{prompt}",
