        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-3129b823e2664f",
          "alias": "Tom Bagshaw-Inspired Digital Painting",
          "prompt": "Style: A hauntingly elegant digital painting style built on desaturated color palettes broken by a single striking accent hue, porcelain-pale skin rendered with soft painterly translucency, richly detailed fabric, rendered in fine contrasting detail against loosely blurred or minimal backgrounds, subjects posed with a still, melancholic, intimacy, and a delicate, painterly restraint that favors quiet mood and texture over dramatic action. Influenced by: Tom Bagshaw,  digital matte painting technique, muted chiaroscuro illustration.. Subject:{prompt}",
