        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-5972c18dfa9c4d",
          "alias": "Action Movie Poster with Diagonal Speed Strokes",
          "prompt": "Style: A composition built on aggressive diagonal motion streaks slashing behind the subject,  the strokes applied with a dry, fractured drag that skips across the canvas creating an explosive backlit burst of velocity and impact, the subject rendered with razor-sharp clarity and cinematic rim lighting while the surrounding strokes dissolve into raw kinetic abstraction, the atmosphere charged with high-stakes intensity, the contrast between the hyper-detailed subject and the chaotic streaked background amplifying the sense of motion, power, and larger-than-life heroism. Influenced by: Drew Struzan's illustrated movie poster compositions, the fractured-speed aesthetic of Marvel Studios key art, Saul Bass's dynamic diagonal poster design, Hollywood blockbuster marketing,. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-cover_art_封面艺术",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0204.jpg",
