          "id": "krea2mood397-3886340b1a9745",
          "alias": "Design",
          "prompt": "Style: A clean, purposeful graphic-illustration style built on confident, simplified shape construction that prioritizes function and clarity over decorative detail, flat or minimally gradated color application applied with intentional restraint, a balanced, structured compositional logic guided by clear visual hierarchy, deliberate, uncluttered spacing that lets each element read instantly, and a versatile, contemporary graphic-design clarity rooted in modern commercial and digital design convention. Influenced by: modern graphic-design tradition, minimalist design practice, contemporary commercial-design technique, digital-design composition method.. Subject:{prompt}",
