          "id": "krea2mood397-2eb5c1ce177446",
          "alias": "Butcher Billy Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, graphic retro-pop illustration style built on flat, punchy color-block construction separated by crisp confident outline, a deliberate mash-up sensibility blending mid-century advertising polish with pop-culture iconography, sharp geometric simplification replacing painterly nuance entirely, confident, graphic silhouette design calibrated for instant recognizability, and a witty, nostalgic commercial-art punch that feels both retro and unmistakably contemporary. Influenced by: Butcher Billy, retro-pop graphic-design tradition, mid-century advertising illustration technique, pop-culture mash-up illustration practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
