          "id": "krea2mood397-c5a3969efc4143",
          "alias": "8-Bit Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A blocky, pixel-constrained illustration style built on hard, discrete square units standing in for all line and shading, an extremely limited tonal palette-logic forcing every gradient into stepped, visible bands, deliberate geometric simplification that reduces anatomy to its most essential recognizable silhouette, a rigid, grid-locked precision replacing any curved or organic mark-making, and a nostalgic, technically constrained charm that celebrates the aesthetic discipline of early digital-display limitation. Influenced by: early video-game sprite-art tradition, Nintendo Entertainment System graphics technique, pixel-art illustration practice, retro arcade visual-design method.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-design_设计",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0208.jpg",
