          "alias": "Graphic Flat-Vector Travel Poster Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, hand-cut illustration style built on faceted, angular shape construction that reduces form into confident planar segments rather than smooth gradation, sharp textural crosshatching and scratchy directional mark-making overlaid across otherwise flat color-block regions, a poster-ready graphic clarity balanced against loose, painterly energy at the edges, dramatic sunlit contrast carving crisp separation between illuminated and shadowed planes, and a stylish, contemporary travel-illustration polish that feels equally editorial and hand-crafted. Influenced by: contemporary vector-travel-poster illustration, faceted geometric-painting technique, mid-century advertising illustration tradition, editorial flat-color rendering practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
