          "id": "krea2mood397-53a34a16a6f34d",
          "alias": "Poster Art",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, graphic illustration style built on confident, simplified composition designed to communicate instantly at a distance, flat or minimally gradated color application applied with deliberate visual punch, strong compositional hierarchy that guides the eye directly to a single focal statement, meticulous economy of detail favoring immediate readability over exhaustive rendering, and a striking, commercial-grade graphic impact rooted in traditional advertising and print-design practice. Influenced by: mid-century poster-design tradition, commercial advertising-illustration technique, graphic-design composition practice, print-poster illustration method.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-design_设计",
