        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-298b559f377648",
          "alias": "Minimalist Line Art",
          "prompt": "Style: A pared-down illustration style built on a single confident, continuous line tracing form with extreme economy, near-total absence of shading or fill beyond the line itself, deliberate restraint that suggests rather than fully describes structure, meticulous control over line weight as the sole carrier of expression and rhythm, and a quiet, contemplative elegance that treats empty space as equally important as the mark itself. Influenced by: Pablo Picasso's single-line drawings, contemporary minimalist illustration tradition, continuous-line drawing technique, modern editorial line-art practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-design_设计",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0220.jpg",
