        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-f7da2d7ca4ee4e",
          "alias": "Origami",
          "prompt": "Style: A geometric, faceted illustration style built on crisp, angular folds constructing form entirely through flat planar segments rather than curved or blended transition, sharp crease lines defining every structural boundary with mathematical precision, minimal shading reduced to simple contrast between adjoining folded segments, a confident, economical construction logic where each fold serves clear structural purpose, and a quietly elegant, meditative craftsmanship rooted in the discipline of paper-folding tradition. Influenced by: traditional Japanese origami tradition, geometric paper-folding technique, low-poly faceted-illustration practice, minimalist structural-design method.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-design_设计",
