        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-5ee82c2435ec42",
          "alias": "Digital Painting",
          "prompt": "Style: A richly layered illustration style built on confident brushwork translated through digital tools while retaining the tactile logic of traditional painting, meticulous control over light behavior achieved through non-destructive layered blending, visible painterly texture preserved even within highly refined rendering, a technically flexible balance between loose gestural mark-making and precise, considered detail, and a polished, contemporary painterly gravitas that bridges classical technique with modern production tools. Influenced by: contemporary digital-painting tradition, Photoshop/Procreate painting workflow, classical oil-painting technique translated digitally, modern concept-art rendering practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
