        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-5f9a55deb8d94d",
          "alias": "Gris Grimly-Inspired Hyperrealism",
          "prompt": "Style: A hyperrealistic gothic-macabre illustration style built on gnarled, spindly proportion rendered with obsessive photographic precision rather than loose sketch energy, meticulously detailed texture giving twisted, elongated form an uncanny, tangible weight, dramatic isolated lighting carving stark contrast between richly rendered detail and enveloping shadow, a hushed, eerie theatricality heightened rather than softened by the hyperreal finish, and a darkly whimsical yet unsettling intensity that feels both storybook and disturbingly convincing. Influenced by: Gris Grimly, hyperrealist digital-painting technique, gothic macabre-illustration tradition, dark-fantasy character-design practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-digital_painting_数字绘画",
