          "alias": "ArtStation Masterpiece",
          "prompt": "Style: A high-production concept-art illustration style built on meticulously controlled rendering that balances painterly atmosphere with technical precision, dramatic cinematic lighting establishing mood and scale within a single portfolio-ready composition, richly detailed material and textural nuance rewarding close inspection without sacrificing overall painterly cohesion, confident, ambitious compositional scale calibrated for maximum visual impact at first glance, and a polished, industry-grade rendering intensity built to command attention within a competitive professional showcase. Influenced by: contemporary ArtStation concept-art community tradition, painterly digital-illustration technique, industry-standard portfolio-rendering practice, cinematic concept-art composition method.. Subject:{prompt}",
