        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-b34f25bb68844e",
          "alias": "Playful Hand-Drawn Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A loose, charming illustration style with visibly hand-inked or hand-painted linework that keeps a warm, imperfect human touch, bouncy exaggerated proportions and expressive gesture-driven poses, bright cheerful color palettes applied in flat or lightly textured washes, whimsical small details and doodle-like embellishments scattered through the composition, and a lighthearted, storybook charm that feels immediate, joyful, and unpolished in the best way. Influenced by: Quentin Blake, children's picture-book illustration, gouache and watercolor sketching, modern editorial doodle art.. Subject:{prompt}",
