          "alias": "Children's Book Drawing",
          "prompt": "Style: A warm, gentle illustration style built on soft, simplified linework carrying a sincere, approachable charm, delicate flat-to-lightly-shaded color application applied with cheerful, unhurried restraint, rounded, endearing proportions favoring emotional warmth over anatomical precision, generous, uncluttered composition that gives each small detail room to breathe, and a tender, timeless storybook sincerity that feels handmade, comforting, and quietly imaginative. Influenced by: golden-age children's-book illustration tradition, gouache-and-ink storybook technique, gentle character-design practice, whimsical picture-book method.. Subject:{prompt}",
