          "id": "krea2mood397-ebd4fa035caa4f",
          "alias": "Etching",
          "prompt": "Style: A meticulous printmaking-inspired illustration style built on dense, fine crosshatched linework that constructs every tone and volume purely through line density rather than flat shading, crisp needle-precise detail rendered with old-world engraving discipline, restrained tonal range achieved through layered hatching passes rather than smooth gradients, a quiet, antique gravitas carried through the deliberate, unhurried linework, and a refined, scholarly print-craft polish that feels historical, meticulous, and timeless. Influenced by: classical etching and engraving technique, Albrecht Dürer, printmaking illustration tradition, Gustave Doré linework.. Subject:{prompt}",
