        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-b530d90cfaf743",
          "alias": "Poe-Inspired Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A haunting gothic-macabre illustration style steeped in melancholy and dread, rendered in desaturated colors, ash-gray, and deep black tones pierced by isolated light, decaying Victorian vibes, symbolic motifs woven through the composition, delicately cross-hatched or ink-washed texture recalling antique engraving, and a brooding, poetic atmosphere of obsession, grief, and quiet horror. Influenced by: Harry Clarke, gothic engraving illustration, Victorian mourning art, Gustave Doré.. Subject:{prompt}",
