        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-3f3d71d1c22b4b",
          "alias": "Pastel-Toned Cute Illustration (Western-Korean Hybrid)",
          "prompt": "Style: A gentle, softly rounded illustration style built on smooth, evenly diffused shading applied with cheerful, uncomplicated clarity, delicate blush-and-glow accents settling softly across rendered features, a hushed, sweet stillness carried through clean, uncluttered composition, an appealing blend of Western cartoon roundness and Korean kawaii-adjacent daintiness in proportion and expression, and a wholesome, gently affectionate charm that feels bright, sincere, and effortlessly endearing. Influenced by: contemporary Korean kawaii-illustration tradition, Western flat-cartoon character-design technique, cute-culture digital-illustration practice, pastel-focused character-art method.. Subject:{prompt}",
