        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-6118de5fde2f4b",
          "alias": "Glen Keane Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A fluid, expressive hand-drawn animation illustration style built on confident, sweeping linework that carries real weight and momentum through every gesture, richly modeled form built with sculptural, almost three-dimensional volume despite being fundamentally linear, exaggerated yet anatomically grounded proportion emphasizing emotional expressiveness over rigidity, a warm, painterly sense of light suggested through soft graphite-like shading beneath confident contour, and a masterful, deeply emotive hand-drawn intensity that feels alive, weighty, and effortlessly graceful. Influenced by: Glen Keane, golden-age Disney animation tradition, expressive hand-drawn character-animation technique, sculptural gesture-drawing practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-drawing_素描",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0275.jpg",
