          "id": "krea2mood397-1f0b2502c80e47",
          "alias": "Calligraphic Linework",
          "prompt": "Style: refined line-centric aesthetics characterized by fluid strokes, graceful visual rhythm, expressive contour variation, elegant mark-making, and exceptional draftsmanship, emphasizing movement, balance, and artistic confidence through controlled line weight, organic transitions, and a harmonious interplay between precision and spontaneity, reminiscent of Egon Schiele and Katsuya Terada, inspired by The Book of Kells and Ukiyo-e brush drawing traditions.0. Subject:{prompt}",
