        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-7df3b4de682d40",
          "alias": "Traditional Marker Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: handcrafted illustration aesthetics characterized by visible marker strokes, layered pigment buildup, rich tonal layering, controlled color blending, and confident sketch-based construction. The style emphasizes spontaneity, design clarity, and tactile artistic process, combining expressive linework with deliberate rendering decisions that preserve the character of traditional media. Rather than pursuing flawless digital smoothness, it celebrates material texture, artist hand presence, and dynamic visual energy through overlapping strokes, selective detail, and efficient visual communication. The resulting imagery feels immediate, vibrant, and authentically crafted, balancing presentation-quality finish with the warmth and personality of traditional illustration techniques, reminiscent of Mike Mignola's marker studies and Scott Robertson, inspired by The Skillful Huntsman and Design Studio Press marker rendering tutorials.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-drawing_素描",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0277.jpg",
          "tags": [
            "Krea2 情绪版",
