        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-1661f40a61ae46",
          "alias": "Western Cel-Shaded Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A bright, cheerful cartoon-illustration style built on thick, confident discontinuous outline holding rounded, super-deformed proportion, flat, evenly applied color fill with minimal shading beyond soft contact shadow, sparkling highlight accents for maximum emotional charm, energetic frame, and a joyful, polish that feels playful, festive, and effortlessly appealing. Influenced by: Nintendo Kirby promotional art,Western indie-cartoon design tradition, flat-color illustration technique, celebratory merchandise-illustration practice, contemporary Western adjacent cartoon method.. Subject:{prompt}",
