        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-31ee83d9cec84f",
          "alias": "Stick-Figure Child Drawing",
          "prompt": "Style: A radically minimal illustration style built on the barest possible linework needed to suggest form, simple circular head and straight-line limbs replacing any anatomical detail entirely, a wobbly, unpracticed economy of gesture , and a charmingly crude, innocent simplicity that feels spontaneous, playful, and completely unpolished. Influenced by: child-art tradition, crayon drawing technique, kindergarten art, naive-art,. Subject:{prompt}",
