        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-3cd4ef36b01746",
          "alias": "Abstract Expressionism",
          "prompt": "Style: A raw, gestural painting style built on sweeping, spontaneous brushwork that prioritizes emotional intensity over representational accuracy, bold physical mark-making where the visible energy of the stroke becomes the subject itself, dramatic tonal contrast and dense layered texture built through accumulated, unrestrained applications of paint, a chaotic yet deliberate compositional freedom that resists conventional structure, and a raw, cathartic painterly intensity that channels pure emotional immediacy over polished technique. Influenced by: Jackson Pollock, Willem de Kooning, action painting technique, mid-century American painting movement.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-painting_绘画",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0282.jpg",
