        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-e4c7cd8a89034e",
          "alias": "Pin-Up",
          "prompt": "Style: A charming, playful glamour-illustration style built on smooth, confident linework tracing idealized, curve-forward proportion with cheerful vitality, soft, evenly blended shading giving skin a flattering, luminous glow, a flirtatious, lighthearted posing sensibility charged with cheeky confidence, meticulous attention to graceful gesture and inviting expression, and a nostalgic, wholesome glamour charm that feels playful, warm, and effortlessly appealing. Influenced by: Gil Elvgren, Alberto Vargas, classic American pin-up illustration tradition, mid-century airbrush glamour technique.. Subject:{prompt}",
