        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-d3ede474639641",
          "alias": "2020s Pin-Up",
          "prompt": "Style: A polished, contemporary glamour-illustration style built on smooth digital rendering that blends idealized, curve-forward proportion with a cleaner, high-production finish than its mid-century roots, richly airbrushed shading giving skin a flawless, luminous glow, a confident, self-assured posing sensibility balancing playful charm with modern empowerment, meticulous attention to crisp, contemporary silhouette and expression, and a vibrant, current glamour-illustration polish that feels playful, confident, and unmistakably of-the-moment. Influenced by: contemporary digital pin-up illustration tradition, semi-realistic airbrush-rendering technique, modern glamour-illustration practice, digital-painting portrait method.. Subject:{prompt}",
