        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-aa5c72776aaf40",
          "alias": "Hyperrealism",
          "prompt": "Style: A meticulously rendered painting style built on obsessive photographic precision that reproduces every subtle tonal shift and textural nuance with painstaking accuracy, dramatic, controlled lighting establishing convincing sculptural dimensionality throughout, countless layered passes building convincing depth and translucency beneath the outermost extent, a disciplined, patient rendering approach that prioritizes photographic conviction over visible brushwork, and a technically virtuosic intensity that treats absolute fidelity itself as the compositional achievement. Influenced by: Chuck Close, hyperrealist oil-painting tradition, photorealism painting technique, contemporary hyperreal-portraiture practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
