          "id": "krea2mood397-062c00ed87814d",
          "alias": "Grindhouse Poster Illustration",
          "prompt": "Style: A lurid, exploitation-cinema illustration style built on bold, high-saturation graphic composition anchored by a dramatic, central figure, painterly airbrushed rendering charged with sensationalist, over-the-top intensity, sharp, angular shadow shapes suggesting danger and spectacle in equal measure, a deliberate tension between garish showmanship and gritty pulp menace, and a brash, unapologetically sleazy theatrical energy built for maximum newsstand shock value. Influenced by: 1970s grindhouse film-poster tradition, exploitation-cinema illustration technique, pulp-thriller poster design, airbrush cinematic-poster practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
