        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-b700ea502b6e47",
          "alias": "Contemporary Gothic Art",
          "prompt": "Style: A darkly atmospheric illustration style built on deep, engulfing tenebrist shadow that swallows the edges of every composition, meticulous ornamental detail rendered with obsessive, moody precision, luminous, porcelain-pale skin contrasted against densely rendered dark ornamentation, a hushed, melancholic stillness carried through restrained directional glow, and a haunting, romantic intensity that feels both reverent and quietly unsettling. Influenced by: Marta Bevacqua, Andrew Ferez, contemporary dark-portrait photography practice, gothic-romantic digital-painting technique.. Subject:{prompt}",
