        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-36279a26c66a44",
          "alias": "Norman Rockwell Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A warm, narrative-driven illustration style built on meticulous, brushy realism with sincere, storytelling detail, confident tonal modeling giving convincing dimensional presence, a nostalgic, wholesome sensibility carried through carefully staged, relatable composition, richly rendered expression and gesture conveying gentle humor or quiet emotion, and a timeless, homespun sincerity that feels deeply American, comforting, and effortlessly narrative. Influenced by: Norman Rockwell, Golden Age American illustration tradition, oil-painting technique, magazine-cover narrative-illustration practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
