        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-4378fa169d6d48",
          "alias": "Edvard Munch Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A raw, emotionally charged painting style built on sweeping, wave-like brushwork that distorts form into expressive, undulating curves, an anxious, unsettled compositional rhythm carried through swirling, restless linework, a limited, heavy tonal range weighted toward oppressive darkness broken by isolated, searing highlight, dramatic elongation and distortion of figure conveying raw psychological turmoil, and a haunting, deeply personal painterly intensity that feels visceral, unsettled, and quietly overwhelming. Influenced by: Edvard Munch, Expressionist painting tradition, symbolist figurative-painting technique, emotionally driven brushwork practice.. Subject:{prompt}",
