        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-10b9ec8b38454f",
          "alias": "Modern Klimt-Inspired Flat Collage Art",
          "prompt": "Style: A richly ornamental illustration style built on dense, mosaic-like flat shapes assembled together in place of naturalistic modeling, a deliberately flattened sense of depth that abandons perspective entirely in favor of a single unified picture-extent, meticulous decorative patterning applied with mathematical, tessellated precision across every region, a hushed, reverent stillness carried through symmetrical, deliberate composition, and a luminous, contemporary decorative elegance that bridges early-20th-century ornamental painting with a modern collage-driven graphic sensibility. Influenced by: Gustav Klimt, contemporary flat-collage illustration technique, tessellated decorative-pattern practice, Byzantine mosaic-adjacent compositional method.. Subject:{prompt}",
