          "id": "krea2mood397-3d625a78417540",
          "alias": "Henri Matisse Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A bold, joyful painting style built on flat, confidently bounded color fields applied with expressive, almost naive simplicity, dynamic organic cut-shape composition favoring rhythmic decorative pattern over naturalistic modeling, a liberated, unmodulated brushwork that celebrates pure color relationship over blended tone, a lively, compositional energy carried through curving, simplified form, and a joyful, painterly intensity that feels free, vibrant, and unmistakably modernist. Influenced by: Henri Matisse, Fauvism painting tradition,. Subject:{prompt}",
