          "alias": "Cinematic Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A dramatically composed photographic style built on deliberate, film-like framing that favors wide aspect ratios and purposeful negative space, controlled color-grading logic that unifies highlight and shadow into a single cohesive mood, soft, motivated lighting sources that feel narratively justified rather than purely technical, a patient, unhurried compositional stillness charged with implied story beyond the frame, and a polished, narrative-driven visual gravitas rooted in feature-film visual-language tradition. Influenced by: Roger Deakins cinematography tradition, anamorphic-lens visual technique, narrative film-lighting practice, color-grading post-production method.. Subject:{prompt}",
