          "id": "krea2mood397-c127189fef6f4c",
          "alias": "Editorial Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A considered, narrative-driven photographic style built on deliberate, purposeful lighting calibrated to support a story rather than purely flatter, confident, composed framing designed for immediate publication-ready clarity, a polished, magazine-grade retouching finish that idealizes without erasing character, meticulous attention to context and mood woven into every compositional choice, and a sharp, professional editorial authority that feels timely, considered, and unmistakably publication-ready. Influenced by: contemporary editorial-photography tradition, magazine-photography technique, narrative-driven photojournalism practice, publication-photography method.. Subject:{prompt}",
