          "id": "krea2mood397-7ea64fc46c0b47",
          "alias": "Cross-Processed Film Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A chemically unpredictable photographic technique built on deliberately mismatched development chemistry that shifts tonal balance into unexpected, unnatural territory, a bold, punchy contrast that pushes highlights and shadows into exaggerated separation, an unstable, shifting cast that colors the entire frame with an unpredictable tonal signature, a gritty, slightly degraded texture inherent to the chemical mismatch, and a raw, experimental authenticity that turns process error into deliberate aesthetic signature. Influenced by: cross-processing darkroom technique, experimental analog-photography tradition, fashion-editorial film practice, alternative-process photographic method.. Subject:{prompt}",
