        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-0101dafdda0844",
          "alias": "Cyberpunk Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A high-contrast, neon-drenched photographic style built on intense directional gel lighting that crosses the frame in sharp, saturated bands, wet-look reflective skin and atmosphere achieved through deliberate humid haze and moisture-catching highlight, dramatic low-angle framing that dwarfs the subject within looming urban density, deep engulfing shadow broken only by isolated glowing accents, and a cold, futuristic tension charged with dystopian nocturnal energy. Influenced by: Blade Runner cinematography tradition, neon-noir photography technique, cyberpunk urban-photography practice, gel-lighting cinematic method.. Subject:{prompt}",
