          "alias": "HDR Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A richly detailed photographic technique built on merging multiple exposures to capture an expanded tonal range beyond a single capture's limitation, meticulously balanced highlight and shadow detail that reveals nuance across the entire dynamic spectrum simultaneously, a hyper-clarified, almost otherworldly evenness in illumination that flattens typical contrast extremes, dense, saturated micro-contrast enhancing texture across every plane, and a technically ambitious, heightened-reality intensity that pushes photographic capture toward a hyper-vivid, almost painterly clarity. Influenced by: high-dynamic-range exposure-blending technique, tone-mapping photographic practice, landscape HDR-photography tradition, technically enhanced digital-photography method.. Subject:{prompt}",
