          "alias": "High-Key Lighting Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A bright, evenly luminous photographic style built on soft, diffused illumination from multiple balanced sources that minimizes shadow and contrast almost entirely, a clean, airy tonal range concentrated in the upper end of the exposure scale, gentle wraparound light that flatters every plane of the subject without harsh falloff, a crisp, optimistic clarity free of moody depth, and a polished, commercial-grade brightness that reads as open, cheerful, and immaculately controlled. Influenced by: high-key studio photography technique, commercial beauty lighting tradition, fashion catalog photography, softbox lighting method.. Subject:{prompt}",
