          "id": "krea2mood397-1d6ec5bf23b640",
          "alias": "Film Noir",
          "prompt": "Style: A stark, high-contrast photographic and cinematic style built on dramatic slatted-shadow patterns cutting sharply across the frame, a single low, hard-angled light source carving deep, engulfing darkness against isolated highlight, a hardboiled, morally ambiguous tension conveyed entirely through shadow and withheld detail, a deliberate, unhurried stillness charged with suspicion and menace, and a moody, cinematic gravitas rooted in mid-century crime-thriller visual tradition. Influenced by: classic film-noir cinematography tradition, chiaroscuro lighting technique, hardboiled crime-thriller visual practice, high-contrast black-and-white photographic method.. Subject:{prompt}",
