          "prompt": "Style: A dynamic, energy-charged photographic style built on deliberate exposure duration that lets movement smear and streak across the frame, sharp, frozen focal elements contrasted against surrounding blurred trails of motion, a kinetic, directional smearing that visually encodes speed and momentum into the still image, unpredictable, organic streaking that varies with the pace and path of movement, and a visceral, immersive sense of velocity that makes stillness itself feel alive with implied motion. Influenced by: long-exposure motion-photography technique, panning-shot photographic practice, kinetic sports-photography method, experimental shutter-speed technique.. Subject:{prompt}",
