          "alias": "Neon Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A vivid, high-contrast photographic style built on intense directional glow radiating from concentrated luminous sources, deep, engulfing shadow surrounding pockets of saturated brilliance, sharp reflective bounce catching and refracting colored light across every plane, an electric, nocturnal energy carried through dramatic tonal extremes, and a moody, atmospheric vibrancy that feels charged, urban, and unmistakably after-dark. Influenced by: neon-noir photography tradition, urban night-photography technique, gel-lighting cinematic practice, contemporary nightlife-photography method.. Subject:{prompt}",
