          "alias": "Soft Beauty-Dish Portrait Rendering",
          "prompt": "Style: A gently flattering portrait-lighting technique, softly diffused light that wraps the face in even, shadowless illumination, a smooth falloff that eliminates harsh contrast while preserving subtle dimensional modeling beneath the eyes and along the jaw, a glossy, luminous quality settling naturally into the eyes, refined tonal transition that keeps skin reading as soft and touchable rather than flat, and a polished, classically flattering studio-portrait clarity built for timeless, dependable beauty photography. Influenced by: beauty-dish studio-lighting technique, classical glamour-photography practice, softbox-adjacent portrait-lighting method, professional beauty-retouching tradition.. Subject:{prompt}",
