        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-41d9906b8d1641",
          "alias": "Streamer Glam Selfie Realism",
          "prompt": "Style: contemporary social-media aesthetics characterized by premium beauty-focused realism, immaculate skin rendering, sophisticated lens behavior, polished image finishing, flattering facial illumination, and a strong sense of aspirational digital presence. The style emphasizes visual confidence, curated authenticity, lifestyle luxury, and camera-aware presentation through refined detail management, subtle optical effects, clean composition, and influencer-era image culture. Rather than editorial formality or cinematic drama, it prioritizes immediacy, relatability, and high-engagement visual appeal while maintaining a technically refined appearance. The resulting imagery feels modern, charismatic, and effortlessly polished, blending lifestyle branding, beauty photography, and creator-culture aesthetics into a visually compelling digital identity, reminiscent of Sam Dameshek and Brandon Woelfel, inspired by Instagram Creator Culture and Twitch Front Page Photography.. Subject:{prompt}",
