          "alias": "Cinematic Tron",
          "prompt": "Style: A sleek futuristic style built on glowing circuitry lines tracing form like living light against deep matte darkness, hard geometric paneling with a digitized, vector-precise silhouette, volumetric haze and lens bloom radiating off every glowing seam, dramatic wide-scale composition establishing cinematic grandeur within a single sweeping frame, and a cold, high-tech intensity that reads as being rendered from pure light and code. Influenced by: Tron: Legacy production design, Syd Mead, vector and vaporwave digital-art technique, cinematic concept-art lighting method.. Subject:{prompt}",
