          "alias": "Refined social-media  photography",
          "prompt": "Style: natural-light–driven editorial imagery emphasizing authenticity and presence, minimalist compositions that center the subject with confident simplicity, soft yet high-contrast lighting that enhances textures without heavy stylization, fashion-forward framing blending casual intimacy with magazine polish, relaxed body language conveying self-possession and modern sensuality, clean color palettes with warm organic hues, contemporary lifestyle aesthetic balanced between candid and posed moments, social-media–era visual language refined for high-end fashion contexts, by Zoë Ghertner, Cass Bird,. Subject:{prompt}",
