        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-a85bceef65b040",
          "alias": "Halation Style",
          "prompt": "Style: A softly radiant photographic technique built on a gentle glow that spreads outward from bright highlight areas, bleeding warmth into surrounding tone rather than staying sharply contained, a hazy, diffused luminosity that softens edges and dissolves crisp contrast, an unhurried, dreamlike quality where light itself seems to overflow its boundaries, delicate atmospheric bloom carried through subtle overexposed brightness, and a nostalgic, cinematic tenderness that feels romantic, hazy, and quietly luminous. Influenced by: halation film-emulsion technique, vintage cinematography lighting practice, glow-diffusion photographic method, soft-focus lens-flare technique.. Subject:{prompt}",
