        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-4d18f8111c6d4d",
          "alias": "Ethereal Memorial Portrait Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A hauntingly luminous photographic style built on soft, diffused illumination that seems to emanate around the subject rather than fall directly upon it, an otherworldly glow separating the figure from its surroundings with gentle, dreamlike radiance, a hushed, elegiac stillness carried through unhurried, reverent framing, delicate soft-focus rendering that blurs the boundary between memory and presence, and a tender, wistful gravitas that treats the subject as simultaneously present and already lost. Influenced by: cinematic flashback-lighting technique, soft-focus memorial-portrait photography, halation-glow diffusion practice, elegiac cinematography tradition.. Subject:{prompt}",
