          "id": "krea2mood397-5e2c4396d3c548",
          "alias": "Translucency-Focused Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A delicately luminous photographic technique built on soft, diffused illumination that seems to pass through rather than bounce off the subject, gentle internal glow settling just beneath the outermost extent, a hazy, ethereal softness replacing sharp, hard-edged contrast, meticulous attention to how light bends and scatters through varying depths, and a quiet, dreamlike intensity that treats the passage of light itself as the compositional subject. Influenced by: translucency-focused studio-lighting technique, backlit portrait-photography practice, soft-diffusion glow method, macro light-transport photographic tradition.. Subject:{prompt}",
