          "id": "krea2mood397-2471550d48a445",
          "alias": "Matrix-Grading Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A cold, high-contrast photographic technique built on a dominant monochromatic-green color cast washing over the entire tonal range, stark, hard-edged directional lighting that carves dramatic separation between illuminated form and deep, engulfing darkness, a slightly desaturated, clinical coldness replacing natural photographic warmth entirely, meticulous crushed-shadow contrast that flattens midtones into stark extremes, and a sleek, dystopian cinematic intensity that feels simulated, sterile, and quietly unsettling. Influenced by: The Matrix cinematography tradition, monochromatic color-grading technique, dystopian film-grading practice, cyberpunk cinematic-photography method.. Subject:{prompt}",
