          "id": "krea2mood397-a58fdb852aa540",
          "alias": "Cosplay Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A polished, character-driven photographic style built on flattering studio or location lighting that renders costume detail with crisp, believable clarity, confident, dynamic posing calibrated to embody a character's personality and energy, meticulous attention to prop and costume texture rendered with genuine photographic conviction, a bright, evenly balanced exposure that keeps every detail legible, and a devoted, high-production convention-photography polish that feels vibrant, expressive, and unmistakably fan-crafted. Influenced by: contemporary convention-photography tradition, character-portrait lighting technique, costume-craft documentation practice, fan-community photographic method.. Subject:{prompt}",
