          "alias": "Outer Form Inner Imagery Interplay",
          "prompt": "Style: A conceptual double-exposure photomontage style where the outer silhouette of a figure functions as a container or window, its surface seamlessly blended with an entirely separate inner scene, glimpsed through translucent overlaps and layered blending, the boundary between subject and embedded imagery dissolving into soft gradient transitions and selective sharp detail, creating a poetic visual metaphor where the figure's interior world is made literally visible. Influenced by: double-exposure photography, Dan Mountford, surrealist collage art, digital photo-manipulation.. Subject:{prompt}",
