        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-d9564fa3657640",
          "alias": "Wes Anderson Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A meticulously symmetrical photographic style built on precise, centered compositional balance where every element is deliberately arranged within a controlled geometric frame, flat, evenly diffused lighting that minimizes dramatic shadow in favor of clean, storybook clarity, a deadpan, static stillness carried through careful, unhurried framing, a restrained, deliberate formality where visual order itself becomes the mood, and a whimsical, meticulously curated precision that feels theatrical yet perfectly controlled. Influenced by: Wes Anderson cinematography tradition, symmetrical composition technique, deadpan visual-comedy framing practice, meticulous production-design photography.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-photography_摄影",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0395.jpg",
          "tags": [
            "Krea2 情绪版",
