        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-e8491e9c30434c",
          "alias": "Underwater Photography",
          "prompt": "Style: A soft, diffused photographic technique built on light scattering and bending as it passes through a dense medium, a gentle, hazy loss of sharpness increasing with distance , a cool, muted tonal cast that deepens and shifts the further the subject recedes, delicate suspended particulate drifting through the frame catching stray beams of light, and a weightless, dreamlike stillness that feels immersive, hushed, and quietly otherworldly. Influenced by: underwater-photography technique, natural-light diffusion, marine documentary photography, ambient light-scattering.. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-photography_摄影",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0396.jpg",
