        {
          "id": "krea2mood397-42259d9d58ca49",
          "alias": "Mexico Color Grading",
          "prompt": "Style: A photographic image pushed through an aggressive digital color grade built on crushed yellows, desaturated ochres, and dusty amber warmth, the midtones shifted decisively toward a sepia-bronze spectrum while the shadows sink into deep, muddy brown-blacks , a heavy tungsten-leaning white balance simmering over every texture. Influenced by: Steven Soderbergh's digital color grading on Traffic and Che, the bleach-bypass warmth of the Mexican narco-cinema palette,. Subject:{prompt}",
          "description": "397 styles｜krea2_397styles-photography_摄影",
          "image": "ray_style_397_0397.jpg",
